    "color": 6,
    "content": "## ⚙️ Persediaan (Gmail + Sheets)\nAliran: **IF → Gmail + Sheets (selari)** — Sheets ambil data BORANG terus.\n\n1. **Gmail** → pilih credential Google (subjek/badan sudah diisi).\n2. **Google Sheets** → pilih credential + **Spreadsheet & Sheet anda**. Kolum sudah dipetakan: Nama Syarikat, Kontak, E-mel, Bajet, Nota, Keputusan.\n\nBorang balas 'Terima kasih' serta-merta (responseMode onReceived)."
